    "detailed_description": "<i><strong>Voxel Creator</strong></i> is a powerful voxel art engine that let's you export your creations for use in your own games or projects!<br>- Quickly create blocky objects and scenes with an easy-to-use interface.<br>- Powerful meshing algorithm allows for unlimited detail (tiny/huge blocks).<br>- Meshes are optimized to generate with fewest possible triangles.<br>- Easily copy, paste, flip and rotate blocks for speedy creation.<br>- Interact with your voxel creations with 'chips'.<br>- Export your voxel art (currently supports OBJ file format) for easy import into your projects (Blender, Unity, etc.)",
    "about_the_game": "<i><strong>Voxel Creator</strong></i> is a powerful voxel art engine that let's you export your creations for use in your own games or projects!<br>- Quickly create blocky objects and scenes with an easy-to-use interface.<br>- Powerful meshing algorithm allows for unlimited detail (tiny/huge blocks).<br>- Meshes are optimized to generate with fewest possible triangles.<br>- Easily copy, paste, flip and rotate blocks for speedy creation.<br>- Interact with your voxel creations with 'chips'.<br>- Export your voxel art (currently supports OBJ file format) for easy import into your projects (Blender, Unity, etc.)",
    "short_description": "Create voxel art and bring it right into your own projects!",
